        "hypothesis": "Combining the previously successful three-way introsort with the archived 65,536-element OpenMP entry point and 16,384-element task grain may expose parallel work on medium-sized arrays while preserving the generated sequence and checksum. Self-swap elision and the inversion reduction are retained as bounded supporting changes.",
